Z||000008||Archie||11-29-2001||10:26 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by DXR_DAD:<BR><B>Rodney "THE MAN" Dickman!!!!!!!<BR>ordered some stuff from him online, 2-3 days later it was at the door!!!!! He is one of the fastest!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>DXR_DAD</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Ya know.... & he's not all that bad lookin' either  eh? Bubba<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Gollie, I'm so happy to have been the 1st. to get in on this thread. You watch now..... this thread will have 50 responses by this time tomorrow.<P>You all will be postin' Rodney this Rodney that. Rodney, Rodney, Rodney everybody loves him (well almost).<P>Somebody ought ta Clone that little bugger.<P>Of all the Vendors and potential Vendors in the Fiero community, Rodney is on my top 5 Vendors list. My top 5 lists includes Rodney, Myself and ...... Hmmmm ..... Hmmmm .... can't think of anyone.....Maybe I should re-name that list of mine.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Just kidding around guys.......<P>I can see Rodney just sitting at his PC right now Smiling and Gushing with pride.... knowing that everybody just loves him. And knowing that his years of working at being the best at what he does has paid off for him in enjoying the admiration of others.<P>It makes a tear come to my eye, just thinking of the pride that is just swelling up inside him right now. Reaping in the rewards of years of toil.<P>Rodney, u b da man<P>====================================<BR>This message sponsored by the Rodney For President Committee. ( <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> just kidding again)<BR>====================================<P>||||reg||14
Z||000009||DXR_DAD||11-29-2001||10:32 PM||||Come on..........Archie you know u-da-man<BR>For a long time I thought your first name was V8  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><BR>DXR_DAD||||reg||10
Z||000010||Archie||11-29-2001||10:38 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by DXR_DAD:<BR><B>For a long time I thought your first name was V8   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>DXR_DAD</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I have some people who call me up and call me "Mr. Archie". My mother named me after an uncle named "InLineAte" but when I was born, I was shorter and more compact & I fit in a smaller place, thus "VeeAte".<P>You don't have to call me Mr. Archie, You can call me "V" or "8" or "V8" or anything you'd like.... just call me.||||reg||1
